{
  "name": "Holy Star of Mystra",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A glowing mote hovers over you while you concentrate (up to 1 minute). When you cast the spell and as a Bonus Action on later turns, it fires a shining bolt at a creature within 120 ft: ranged spell attack, 4d10 + your spellcasting modifier Force or Radiant damage. You have Three-Quarters Cover while it lasts, and when you succeed on a save against a 7th-level or lower spell that targeted only you, you can use your Reaction to send it back at its caster (by hand).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
